WEBVTT

1
00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:37.000
A voice came crying from the wilderness edge

2
00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:44.600
Prepare His way, His hour has nearly come

3
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:52.440
He walked south from the hills of Galilee

4
00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:58.400
To stand where four thousand years of promise led

5
00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:06.920
No sin to wash, no old life to bury

6
00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:12.600
He stepped into the river anyway

7
00:01:15.640 --> 00:01:20.780
The Father's voice heard above the water

8
00:01:21.560 --> 00:01:22.740
This is my Son

9
00:01:24.240 --> 00:01:27.740
I am well pleased with Him today

10
00:01:31.360 --> 00:01:36.960
He could have had anything He desired

11
00:01:39.620 --> 00:01:45.080
Instead He gave everything for those He loves

12
00:01:45.080 --> 00:01:51.180
Into the water, into the wilderness

13
00:01:51.180 --> 00:02:01.360
He was prepared in all things for us

14
00:02:16.180 --> 00:02:20.520
Forty days with nothing but silence and hunger

15
00:02:21.080 --> 00:02:26.900
A voice hissed doubt, tempting self service and pride

16
00:02:28.360 --> 00:02:31.860
Are you who you think you are

17
00:02:31.860 --> 00:02:34.760
Then prove it, take the shortcut

18
00:02:34.760 --> 00:02:40.320
Make your greatness known, rule now

19
00:02:43.400 --> 00:02:48.000
He didn't argue, didn't make it a debate

20
00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:53.020
He reached for the word of God

21
00:02:53.020 --> 00:02:56.320
As one does who knows his worth and truth

22
00:02:57.640 --> 00:03:00.340
And will not move from it

23
00:03:00.340 --> 00:03:09.800
Who came for sacrifice, not imitation of it

24
00:03:12.320 --> 00:03:18.820
He could have had anything He desired

25
00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:26.880
Instead He gave everything for those He loves

26
00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:32.940
Into the water, into the wilderness

27
00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:43.080
He was prepared in all things for us

28
00:03:55.980 --> 00:04:00.780
He returned in the power of the Spirit

29
00:04:01.460 --> 00:04:04.600
Not only surviving, strengthened

30
00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:13.500
He stood in the room where He had grown up

31
00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:18.260
And told them what they were looking at

32
00:04:20.080 --> 00:04:23.460
This day, this scripture

33
00:04:23.460 --> 00:04:26.940
Is fulfilled in your hearing

34
00:04:31.220 --> 00:04:38.120
He could have had anything He desired

35
00:04:40.120 --> 00:04:45.800
Instead He gave everything for those He loves

36
00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:51.860
Into the water, into the wilderness

37
00:04:51.860 --> 00:05:01.920
He was prepared in all things for us

38
00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:34.300
For us, for us
